+
+BOUNDED RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+kore-exec: [36576600] Warning (WarnStuckClaimState):
+    The configuration's term unifies with the destination's term, but the
+    implication check between the conditions has failed. Location:
+    /tmp/audit-work/reconstruction/body-mutation-spec.k:8:5-11:49
+...
+The residual condition contrasted:
+  #repeatVals ( "WRONG-ONE" :: .PyVals , #count ( pyList ( XS ) , 1 ) )
+with:
+  #repeatVals ( "One" :: .PyVals , #count ( pyList ( XS ) , 1 ) )
+...
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further. See output for more details.
+
+EXIT STATUS: 1
+
+EXPECTED RESULT: proof rejection because the term actually executed by the
+entry claim changed while its result contract did not.
