+SATISFYING INPUT:
+XS = 9 :: 1 :: .PyVals, corresponding to the Python list [9, 1].
+Both trusted canonical Python and candidate Python return ["Nine", "One"].
+The mutation instead requires ["One", "Nine"].
+
+COMMAND:
+kprove /audit-output/evidence/fresh-nonvacuity-spec.k --definition audit-verification-kompiled --spec-module AUDITOR-FRESH-NONVACUITY --dry-run
